b7f78187ca0a7162509256465ae5e0.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 PLAYABLE CHARACTERS</h2><br>Take control of 3 different Simulakros Units, each having their own unique playstyle with unique weapons, skills and power-ups.<br><br><strong>Sharpshooter</strong>: Sharp and deadly. Fight from a distance with this unit equipped with high precision rifles capable of charging devastating shots and time-manipulation abilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/a0bb823c5bfd7bb12f5de1e1979287d0.poster.avif?t=1744988605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/a0bb823c5bfd7bb12f5de1e1979287d0.webm?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/a0bb823c5bfd7bb12f5de1e1979287d0.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Barrage</strong>: Fast and ruthless. Wield a short-range SMG and a long-range pistol with this unit equipped with explosive energy-based abilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/148211f068713664d088fdd13af4cfa0.poster.avif?t=1744988605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/148211f068713664d088fdd13af4cfa0.webm?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/148211f068713664d088fdd13af4cfa0.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Rupture</strong>: Powerful and fearless. Bring the fight to them with a close-range shotgun and powerful grenades. This unit is pure aggression, capable of surprising enemies by teleporting behind them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/2e5f7c547248604893008cc25dce8437.poster.avif?t=1744988605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/2e5f7c547248604893008cc25dce8437.webm?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/2e5f7c547248604893008cc25dce8437.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION</h2><br>Each run will feel unique as you gather random power-ups and upgrades that change your playstyle and improve your abilities. Will you become strong enough to defeat the CORP?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/4596038fd80991ed9d07522a94883df5.poster.avif?t=1744988605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/4596038fd80991ed9d07522a94883df5.webm?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/4596038fd80991ed9d07522a94883df5.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HORIZONTAL PROGRESSION</h2><br>Inside the CORP facilities you will discover powerful chips that you can equip to permanently improve your ability to control Simulakros Units. Each run will grant you experience, allowing you to equip more and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/cef424d437a54d2c2c5de382da133a1e.poster.avif?t=1744988605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/cef424d437a54d2c2c5de382da133a1e.webm?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067160/extras/cef424d437a54d2c2c5de382da133a1e.mp4?t=1744988605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br>Rise up now. You\u2019re our only hope!",
